PES2202400065@pesuonline.onmicrosoft.com,3,"strr = input()\r\nlstt = strr.split(\",\")\r\nfindd = lstt[0]\r\nfinding = lstt[1]\r\nsumm = 0\r\nfindd = findd.lower()\r\nfinding = finding.lower()\r\nfor x in finding:\r\n    if x == findd:\r\n        summ += 1\r\n    else:\r\n        continue\r\n\r\n\r\nprint(summ)","strr = input()\r\nlstt = strr.split(\",\")\r\nfindd = lstt[0]\r\nfinding = lstt[1]\r\nsumm = 0\r\nfindd = findd.lower()\r\nfinding = finding.lower()\r\nfor x in finding:\r\n    if x == findd:\r\n        summ += 1\r\n    else:\r\n        continue\r\n\r\n\r\nprint(summ)",1734947118229,false,false,true,false
PES2202400065@pesuonline.onmicrosoft.com,3,"strr = input()\r\nlstt = strr.split(\",\")\r\nfindd = lstt[0]\r\nfinding = lstt[1]\r\nsumm = 0\r\nfindd = findd.lower()\r\nfinding = finding.lower()\r\nfor x in finding:\r\n    if x == findd:\r\n        summ += 1\r\n    else:\r\n        continue\r\n\r\n\r\nprint(summ)","strr = input()\r\nlstt = strr.split(\",\")\r\nfindd = lstt[0]\r\nfinding = lstt[1]\r\nsumm = 0\r\nfindd = findd.lower()\r\nfinding = finding.lower()\r\nfor x in finding:\r\n    if x == findd:\r\n        summ += 1\r\n    else:\r\n        continue\r\n\r\n\r\nprint(summ)",1734947120950,false,false,false,true
